.TH LOG 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
LOG \- printf\-style message to the terminal (stderr): LOG("loaded level %d", n)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdebug.h\(dq
.ft B
#define LOG(...) SDL_Log(__VA_ARGS__)
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
printf\-style message to the terminal (stderr): LOG("loaded level %d", n). The engine's own messages (missing assets, save failures) use it too, so run the game from a terminal to see them. No newline needed.
.SH MODULE
debug (src/engine/debug/debug.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR WARN (3),
.BR ASSERT (3),
.BR debug_text (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
